# Baked into the build at build time (Vite env vars are compile-time, not
# runtime) — this must be the address the *browser* can reach the backend
# at, not localhost. Verify this matches the mini's actual Tailscale
# hostname/IP and the backend's port (8000, see the -backend plist) before
# deploying; adjust here and rebuild if it's wrong.
VITE_API_BASE_URL=http://100.114.228.0:8000
